# Reads against the remote-shaped record `tour-remote`: no confirmation, every call in audit.log.
# @env tour-remote

### aws ssm.GetParameter table-name
# @assert $.Parameter.Value == estate-messages
{"Name": "/estate/common/table-name"}

### aws secretsmanager.GetSecretValue api-key
# The decoded answer has the value, the persisted response does not: `$` reads what was persisted.
# @assert $.SecretString == <redacted>
{"SecretId": "estate/api-key"}

### aws sqs.ListQueues queues
# @assert $.QueueUrls[0] contains estate-
{}
